    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a fast-paced micro dungeon crawler, set in a colorful tabletop world of adventuring animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.poster.avif?t=1743350400\" width=744 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.webm?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.mp4?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-combining battle system inspired by the old-school ATB (Active Time Battle) JRPG combat and physical card games such as Star Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three varied regions to master, each with their own enemies, cards and trinkets to find!<br><br>Beautiful card artwork filled with colorful animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket-sized adventure with a playtime of around 2 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.poster.avif?t=1743350400\" width=744 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.webm?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.mp4?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CARDIAN</strong> is a fast-paced micro dungeon crawler, set in a colorful tabletop world of adventuring animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.poster.avif?t=1743350400\" width=744 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.webm?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/1d08213ba261dbcd51b87ea6a2945c09.mp4?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-combining battle system inspired by the old-school ATB (Active Time Battle) JRPG combat and physical card games such as Star Realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three varied regions to master, each with their own enemies, cards and trinkets to find!<br><br>Beautiful card artwork filled with colorful animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pocket-sized adventure with a playtime of around 2 hours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.poster.avif?t=1743350400\" width=744 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.webm?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2968070/extras/ded27167b2c33d5f87bcbaac162e7174.mp4?t=1743350400\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
